"description": "Cimpress Plc engages in web-to-print mass customization, delivering high-quality, affordable custom products quickly and conveniently even in low quantities. It operates through the following segments: Vista, PrintBrothers, Print Group, National Pen and All Other Businesses. The Vista segment consists of the operations of VistaPrint branded websites in North America, Western Europe, Australia, New Zealand, India, and Singapore. The PrintBrothers segment includes the results of druck.at, printdeal, and WIRmachenDRUCK businesses. The Print Group segment focuses on the results of Easyflyer, Exaprint, Pixartprinting, and Tradeprint businesses. The National Pen segment encompasses the global operations of nation pen business, which manufactures and markets custom writing instruments and promotional products, apparel and gifts. The All Other Buisnesses comprises of the collection of businesses grouped together based on materiality. The company was founded by Robert S. Keane in 1995 and is headquartered in Dundalk, Ireland.",
